                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7209c77-a7c7-4a81-9be3-17d62ce161b0",
                                "sense_id": "b0452d6d-b8b5-399b-85e3-9fc647723f74",
                                "text": "His question is a toughie. I might have to do some more research."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "706904d2-50be-3a81-9ac0-c4915c52d18c",
                        "entry_id": "24757e01-0fcd-3c0a-9d52-17f8ad9a0b1c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone or something that is strong and resilient."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac92c931-f826-4ac8-88cf-8030e58fd3f1",
                                "sense_id": "706904d2-50be-3a81-9ac0-c4915c52d18c",
                                "text": "Sansevieria and aspidistra are two old houseplant toughies that make good indoor choices."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6864558-7306-4308-8c43-acf6acf816d6",
                                "sense_id": "706904d2-50be-3a81-9ac0-c4915c52d18c",
                                "text": "With typical courage she had taken hold of her life and changed it for the better. She always was a brave little toughie, and now her courage had paid off."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08863386-dded-449a-8dc0-bcf5bdb4a3b5",
                                "sense_id": "706904d2-50be-3a81-9ac0-c4915c52d18c",
                                "text": "His eyes were red, but his lashes were not beaded with fresh tears. He was something, this little toughie."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "86e0e0f3-f276-3773-88ac-27ee09d25496",
                        "entry_id": "24757e01-0fcd-3c0a-9d52-17f8ad9a0b1c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A tough; Someone or something that acts as a thug or bully."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa860281-fcdd-48ba-957d-6e532d8205ff",
                                "sense_id": "86e0e0f3-f276-3773-88ac-27ee09d25496",
                                "text": "The liberal states, in the present situation, are the \"softies\"; the Fascist states are the \"toughies\". And the toughies are always able to get away with \"murder\" until the softies become tough."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d05a03dd-41df-4ac7-a9fd-5daac6b3c32c",
                                "sense_id": "86e0e0f3-f276-3773-88ac-27ee09d25496",
                                "text": "But we knew she would follow how and why my student and I would immediately detect the similarity in our situation from the studied calmness we had both displayed toward the havoc roused by the toughies to intimidate the new female temporary teacher."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28c4470a-bbbe-4498-a2a5-ed89fb8d0b45",
                                "sense_id": "86e0e0f3-f276-3773-88ac-27ee09d25496",
                                "text": "There was Butch behind the bar, and there sat four of the toughies at their table with their heads all close together and not drunk no more."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07856deb-f214-4109-b895-c228b317df78",
                                "sense_id": "86e0e0f3-f276-3773-88ac-27ee09d25496",
                                "text": "Often I don't even have a partner when I make my rounds as a patrol cop, because of city budget constraints. But when the toughie is armed or there are too many toughies, l have to call for a backup before I make a move."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
